{
  "title": "Contact Us",
  "metaDescription": "Contact the Global Reasoning Challenge organizing team.",
  "body": "<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a> / Contact</div>\n    <span class=\"eyebrow on-dark\">Get in touch</span>\n    <h1>Contact Us</h1>\n    <p>The organizing team is distributed across countries and time zones. Reach out and we will route your message to the right people.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-2\" style=\"align-items:start;\">\n      <form class=\"card form-card\" data-api=\"/api/contact\">\n        <h3>Send a message</h3>\n        <div class=\"form-field\">\n          <label for=\"c-name\">Full name</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"c-name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-field\">\n          <label for=\"c-email\">Email</label>\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"c-email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-field\">\n          <label for=\"c-subject\">Subject</label>\n          <select id=\"c-subject\" name=\"subject\">\n            <option>General question</option>\n            <option>Qualification Round</option>\n            <option>Semi-Final / Final Round</option>\n            <option>Teachers &amp; schools</option>\n            <option>Ambassador Program</option>\n            <option>Certificate verification</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-field\">\n          <label for=\"c-message\">Message</label>\n          <textarea id=\"c-message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"How can we help?\" required></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-dark btn-block\">Send message</button>\n        <p class=\"form-status\" data-form-status></p>\n      </form>\n      <div>\n        <h3>Other ways to reach us</h3>\n        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:info@example.org\">info@example.org</a></p>\n        <p>The Global Reasoning Challenge takes place entirely online, so there is no single office to visit &mdash; our organizing team and ambassador network are spread across the world. Most questions are answered within a few business days.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">Before writing in, check the <a href=\"support.html\">Support &amp; FAQ</a> page &mdash; most common questions about eligibility, rounds, and registration are already answered there.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n"
}